    "family": "journal",
    "contract": "Execute begin, put(key,value), delete(key), commit, rollback operations on an initially empty dictionary. Transactions nest; commit retains current changes, rollback restores the state at the innermost begin. Deleting a missing key is harmless. Unknown operations, unmatched commit/rollback or unclosed transactions return null.",
