    "family": "cache",
    "contract": "Evaluate a capacity-bounded TTL LRU cache using supplied logical timestamps. events are [time,put,key,value,ttl] or [time,get,key]. Expire entries before each operation at expires<=time. Reads refresh LRU order but never extend TTL. Overwriting removes the old entry, including with ttl<=0. Evict least recently used live entry on new insertion. Return get results (null for misses). Reject invalid capacity (including bool) or unknown operations. Input timestamps are nondecreasing.",
